{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日放送された『乃木坂工事中』にて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41枚目シングルの選抜発表がありました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "センターは同期の池田瑛紗"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、他の人より少しばかり彼女の近くにいるから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "彼女のことを知ってるつもり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これから担うものが、どれだけ大きくて重いものであるのかも知っています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どう寄り添っていくのがらしいのか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日まで頭を捻っていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょうど1年前の春、あのときの私に"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なにがあっても味方だ、と彼女は伝えてくれていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしは、そうだなあ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしは、池田瑛紗が好きだっっっっっっっ！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アイドル性も人間性も"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "文章とか､感性とか､思考とか､生み出すものとか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ユーモアも、懐の深さも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人に見せないコンプレックスも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全部、ぜんぶ、ぜーんぶすきだ！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんな茨を歩んで、痛くても血が流れても切り抜けてしまうのがあなただから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒にがんばらせてね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/6d4/02d33ac6fa3ca9db94776b12736fd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/6d4/02d33ac6fa3ca9db94776b12736fd-01.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でっかいラブレターとでっかいエール"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして私は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回のシングルでも、選抜メンバーに選んでいただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2列目下手端"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひとつひとつ､全てのポジションに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんの期待や願望､喜びや悔しさの歴史があることを"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて実感します。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここまで私の手を引いてくれる皆さんの力は、何度も私を奮い立たせてくれていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたが私に抱いてくれている感情"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何ひとつ取りこぼすことなく､この期間を駆け抜けます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんだか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の感謝だけでは物足りない気がしてしまうから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日のブログは､私があなたを幸せにする約束"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41枚目シングル"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくおねがいします！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色んなものが渦巻いています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "期待も不安も寂しさも。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "別れもありますね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても温かく人のことを想ってるのに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなことない素振りをする先輩。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "肩に力は入らないのに､心の奥に気付いてくれる方。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業､早すぎませんか、なんて簡単に声をかけてしまったことを少し後悔してます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "決意をちゃんと受け止めて､笑顔で送り出せるように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きます。"}], "source": "official"}